WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.535
-Here's what people
are talking about --

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.603
some big news out of Washington.

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:06.038
Today President Trump officially
removed

00:00:06.038 --> 00:00:09.942
Anthony Scaramucci
as his communications director.

00:00:09.942 --> 00:00:11.043
And this is a little awkward,

00:00:11.043 --> 00:00:12.178
when Scaramucci called an Uber

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.479
to pick him up
at the White House,

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:16.148
Sean Spicer was driving.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.148 --> 00:00:17.616
-That's not good.
-Can you imagine the odds?

00:00:17.616 --> 00:00:19.819
The odds of that happening.
-Awkward.

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:21.254
-That's right.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:25.224
Scaramucci lost his job
after just 10 days,

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:27.727
following an obscene interview
with<i> The New Yorker.</i>

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.528
You know it's bad when
you get fired after 10 days

00:00:29.528 --> 00:00:31.530
and everyone's still like,
"What took you so long?"

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:34.834
[ Laughter and applause ]
That's bad.

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.603
So he's out.
He's out after just 10 days.

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:39.339
So Scaramucci is gone,

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:41.074
but his cologne
will linger forever.

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:43.510
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:45.911
And get this,
Scaramucci's official start date

00:00:45.911 --> 00:00:47.647
was supposed to be August 15th.

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:50.015
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.015 --> 00:00:53.052
Or as Trump put it, "See,
we're setting so many records.

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:54.320
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.789
"He's the first person
to ever get fired

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:58.324
before they start working."

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:01.560
[ Applause ]
"We're setting so many records."

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:04.697
And it came out that

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:07.666
Scaramucci actually missed
the birth of his son last week

00:01:07.666 --> 00:01:09.201
because he was with Trump.

00:01:09.201 --> 00:01:10.602
So he -- this is real --

00:01:10.602 --> 00:01:12.672
he texted his wife
congratulations.

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:14.974
[ Audience "ohh"s ]

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.142
Trump was like,

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:18.911
"You don't text your wife
after she has your baby.

00:01:18.911 --> 00:01:23.416
You tweet her."
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:26.252
Tweet.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:28.521
That's right, last week was
the craziest week yet

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:29.688
for the Trump White House,

00:01:29.688 --> 00:01:30.923
and when things get crazy,

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:33.759
the GOP turns to its fans
for support.

00:01:33.759 --> 00:01:36.429
Luckily, the GOP's biggest fan
is with us tonight.

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:38.464
So here to offer them
some words of encouragement

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:41.300
is GOP fanboy John Early.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:42.402
Hey, John.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:45.004
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:47.840
Thank you so much
for this popcorn, Jimmy.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.809
[ Laughs ]

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:52.111
-Now, please.

00:01:52.111 --> 00:01:54.781
So, what do you have to say
to the GOP?

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:57.117
-To my boys in the GOP,

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:59.619
don't let those haters
get you down!

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:02.021
Despite some minor hiccups
this past week,

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:03.556
and every week before that,

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:06.458
you guys continue to slay
all day!

00:02:06.458 --> 00:02:09.661
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:09.661 --> 00:02:13.766
-Now, John, on Friday,

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:16.202
Reince Priebus was forced out
as chief of staff,

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:18.170
after just six months
in the position.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:19.639
Do you have a message
for Mr. Priebus?

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:22.175
-Keep your chin up, Reince.

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:23.610
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:27.446
Daddy's not -- sorry, Donald's
not mad, just disappointed.

00:02:27.446 --> 00:02:30.716
Take your time out to think
about what you've done.

00:02:30.716 --> 00:02:32.852
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:39.492
-And Priebus leaving
just came a day after

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:41.094
Anthony Scaramucci
called<i> The New Yorker</i>

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:43.129
to rant about Priebus
and Steve Bannon,

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:44.430
and now he's fired.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.532
Do have any words of support
for Scaramucci?

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:49.401
-Keep telling it like it is,
"Mooch"!

00:02:49.401 --> 00:02:53.372
We as a nation love that
you're not PC and/or fake.

00:02:53.372 --> 00:02:55.374
Enjoy that time off, babe.

00:02:55.374 --> 00:02:58.043
I hope you spend it
like Steve Bannon would,

00:02:58.043 --> 00:02:59.512
by sucking your own --

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:01.480
-Oh, hey!
John, John, John, John, John.

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:03.283
[ Laughter and applause ]
John.

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:04.484
-What?

00:03:04.484 --> 00:03:06.486
-John, you're on
national television.

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:08.487
-I can't hear anything
you're saying right now.

00:03:08.487 --> 00:03:10.890
I think
it's a connection-based issue.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:14.727
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:16.128
-We'll work on that.

00:03:16.128 --> 00:03:18.197
Well, finally the GOP is having
a lot of trouble

00:03:18.197 --> 00:03:19.966
getting a new
health care bill passed.

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:22.168
President Trump has called out
the Republican Senators

00:03:22.168 --> 00:03:23.636
on Twitter, telling them

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:25.671
they need to repeal
and replace Obamacare.

00:03:25.671 --> 00:03:27.740
Anything you want to say
to Donald Trump about this?

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.776
-Stay strong, D.T.

00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:31.510
You better work!

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:34.747
And by work, I mean needlessly
take away the health care

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:37.650
from the very people
you promised to protect.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.185
Who hurt you?

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:40.919
[ Applause ]

00:03:40.919 --> 00:03:43.723
-GOP fanboy John Early,
everyone.

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:46.826
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:46.826 --> 00:03:51.763
[ Laughing ]

00:03:51.763 --> 00:03:53.232
And we talked about this
last week.

00:03:53.232 --> 00:03:56.769
President Trump responded to
a letter from a 9-year-old boy,

00:03:56.769 --> 00:03:58.671
nicknamed "Pickle," who wrote in

00:03:58.671 --> 00:04:00.372
to say that he was
a fan of the president.

00:04:00.372 --> 00:04:03.175
Well, Pickle actually went on
"Fox and Friends" this weekend.

00:04:03.175 --> 00:04:05.812
Take a look at his reaction
to one of their questions.

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:07.680 line:0%
-You know, a lot of kids write
letters to the White House,

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.515 line:0%
but not all of them
get an answer

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:11.417 line:0%
from the president himself.

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:13.085 line:0%
What did you think
when you heard

00:04:13.085 --> 00:04:14.487 line:0%
the president
had read your letter

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:16.122 line:0%
and wants to be your friend?

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:21.394 line:0%
What'd you think, buddy?
-What'd you think?

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:23.996 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.996 --> 00:04:26.966 line:0%
-You're shocked?
[ Laughter ]

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:29.368
-That kid was so good
at avoiding questions,

00:04:29.368 --> 00:04:30.769
Trump named him White House
communications director.

00:04:30.769 --> 00:04:31.904
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Wow.

00:04:31.904 --> 00:04:33.906
-Today.
-Today.

00:04:33.906 --> 00:04:35.041
-Pickle.

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:37.676
Pickle --
Pickle is in the White House.

00:04:37.676 --> 00:04:41.681
And finally, I read that
five baby flamingos

00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:44.016
were just born
at the Sacramento Zoo.

00:04:44.016 --> 00:04:45.217
[ Audience "aww"s ]

00:04:45.217 --> 00:04:46.652
And this was nice,
the mother even got a text

00:04:46.652 --> 00:04:48.755
from Anthony Scaramucci
saying congratulations.

